[?2004l[?2004h> ---
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Timeline of Events
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Initial Access**: Attacker initiated RDP Brute Force (`T1110`) against exposed RDP service on `rdp-prod-01` from IP `198.51.100.92` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`). Entry was made possible by Network Level Authentication (NLA) being disabled (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Logon & Execution**: Attacker logged in via RDP (`T1021.001`) and executed PowerShell/scripts (`T1059.001`) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Malware Deployment**: Ransomware binary `svc.exe` dropped in `/Users/Public/svc.exe` (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`), encrypting target files to `.locked` (`T1486`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. **Persistence Establishment**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Scheduled task `UpdateHelper` created to run `svc.exe` every 5 minutes (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`, `T1053.005`).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Registry Run key added under `HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run` pointing to `C:\\Users\\Public\\svc.exe` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`, `T1547.001` - **SILENT/UNALERTED**).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Malicious service/driver `svc-helper` installed (`/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`, `T1543.003`, `EventID 7045` in `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 5. **C2 & Mining Activity**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - C2 beaconing to `update-rdp[.]example[.]cn` / `198.51.100.92` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Mining pool connection string `stratum+tcp[:]//xmr[.]rdp[.]evil[:]3333` and wallet `4A0000000000000000000e4435cc95c5` embedded in binaries (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 6. **Anti-Forensics / Defense Evasion**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Security Event Log cleared (EventID 1102) (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`, `T1070.001` - **SILENT/UNALERTED**).
[?2004l[?2004h> EOF
